<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 370)</h2>
<p><b>A broken preview no longer kills a Kitsu pull.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Pulling a playlist that references a preview whose file is missing on the server used to abort the whole pull with a raw error. It now pulls everything it can and then warns you, naming the broken shots: "Pulled 6 — 1 clip is broken on the server (preview missing): SHOT_NAME."</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
